nker. Then, the survival begins. Each day, you venture into the Exclusion Zone to scavenge procedurally generated locations: abandoned military bases and research stations, radioactive wastelands, and ruined cities.", "summary": "Misery is a 1\u20135 player co-op survival game set in a nuclear disaster zone. Here, every day is a struggle: search radioactive ruins for resources, build your bunker, craft weapons, and explore a weird, procedurally-generated world with your friends. Beware of anomalies, monsters, and armed bandits.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/misery", "videos": [{"id": 149028, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "qXjq_8UuoCI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qXjq_8UuoCI", "title": "MISERY - Official Announce Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qXjq_8UuoCI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 159276, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "15qS2rTVh-Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=15qS2rTVh-Q", "title": "MISERY - Offical Release Date Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/15qS2rTVh-Q/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 165920, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "BLMcHh2-cDQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BLMcHh2-cDQ", "title": "MISERY - Official Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BLMcHh2-cDQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}